2Ch 25:1 , Amaziah begins to reign well;
2Ch 25:3 , He executes justice on the traitors;
2Ch 25:5 , Having hired an army of Israelites against the Edomites, at the word of a prophet dismisses them;
2Ch 25:11 , He overthrows the Edomites;
2Ch 25:13 , The Israelites, discontented with their dismission, spoil as they return home;
2Ch 25:14 , Amaziah, proud of his victory, serves the gods of Edom, and despises the admonitions of the prophet;
2Ch 25:17 , He provokes Joash to his overthrow;
2Ch 25:25 , His reign;
2Ch 25:27 , He is slain by conspiracy.
